00:10:05,420 --> 00:10:07,586
The Commerce Department says it handled

294
00:10:07,586 --> 00:10:09,269
the case by the book.

295
00:10:09,517 --> 00:10:12,165
Megaspeed calls the reporting misleading,

296
00:10:12,165 --> 00:10:14,614
and says regulators and Nvidia found no

297
00:10:14,614 --> 00:10:18,107
evidence of any illegal transfer of chips.

298
00:10:18,107 --> 00:10:19,545
It has not been charged,

299
00:10:19,545 --> 00:10:21,422
and it is not on the government's

300
00:10:21,422 --> 00:10:22,647
trade blacklist.

301
00:10:22,727 --> 00:10:25,447
Nvidia has described Megaspeed as a small

302
00:10:25,447 --> 00:10:26,557
commercial cloud,

303
00:10:26,557 --> 00:10:28,371
and says the diversion claims were

304
00:10:28,371 --> 00:10:31,691
thoroughly investigated and debunked.

305
00:10:31,950 --> 00:10:32,538
So,

306
00:10:32,538 --> 00:10:35,292
with all of that unresolved,

307
00:10:35,292 --> 00:10:37,129
what happens now?

308
00:10:42,783 --> 00:10:43,341
First,

309
00:10:43,341 --> 00:10:45,703
the investigation.

310
00:10:46,093 --> 00:10:48,731
A committee of independent directors,

311
00:10:48,731 --> 00:10:50,347
helped by outside lawyers,

312
00:10:50,347 --> 00:10:53,189
will examine all available information,

313
00:10:53,189 --> 00:10:55,030
and the board has promised further

314
00:10:55,030 --> 00:10:56,243
updates.

315
00:10:56,343 --> 00:10:57,842
Until it reports,

316
00:10:57,842 --> 00:11:00,983
investors are pricing a question mark.

317
00:11:01,217 --> 00:11:01,910
Second,

318
00:11:01,910 --> 00:11:03,467
the calendar.

319
00:11:03,717 --> 00:11:05,899
Nvidia is scheduled to report its

320
00:11:05,899 --> 00:11:09,117
quarterly results on November seventeenth.

321
00:11:09,347 --> 00:11:11,501
And three House committee chairmen have

322
00:11:11,501 --> 00:11:13,895
asked Huang to brief them behind closed

323
00:11:13,895 --> 00:11:15,786
doors on November eighteenth,

324
00:11:15,786 --> 00:11:17,701
saying it is vital that Congress

325
00:11:17,701 --> 00:11:20,573
determines the extent to which national

326
00:11:20,573 --> 00:11:23,567
security has been placed at risk.

327
00:11:23,967 --> 00:11:25,987
It is not yet confirmed that the

328
00:11:25,987 --> 00:11:27,709
briefing will happen.

329
00:11:27,950 --> 00:11:28,536
Third,

330
00:11:28,536 --> 00:11:30,060
politics.

331
00:11:30,060 --> 00:11:33,060
President Trump has publicly backed Huang.

332
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,825
He said Huang told him he had

333
00:11:34,825 --> 00:11:37,991
absolutely no idea that the person in

334
00:11:37,991 --> 00:11:39,428
question was a spy,

335
00:11:39,428 --> 00:11:42,220
and that he really believes him.

336
00:11:42,350 --> 00:11:44,550
That is his account.

337
00:11:44,783 --> 00:11:47,037
So why did Nvidia lose about four

338
00:11:47,037 --> 00:11:49,292
hundred and twenty-eight billion dollars

339
00:11:49,292 --> 00:11:50,643
in two days?

340
00:11:50,703 --> 00:11:53,123
Not because its chips got worse.

341
00:11:53,123 --> 00:11:55,572
Because investors suddenly had to price

342
00:11:55,572 --> 00:11:57,063
two risks at once.

343
00:11:57,163 --> 00:11:58,977
The first is the risk of depending

344
00:11:58,977 --> 00:12:00,383
on one person.

345
00:12:00,443 --> 00:12:02,200
The second is the risk that the

346
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:04,616
rules around its most valuable product

347
00:12:04,616 --> 00:12:07,413
could bite harder than anyone expected.

348
00:12:07,633 --> 00:12:09,282
Neither risk has been shown to have

349
00:12:09,282 --> 00:12:10,913
caused any harm.

350
00:12:10,993 --> 00:12:12,569
The board says it has no reason

351
00:12:12,569 --> 00:12:14,717
to believe secrets were compromised,

352
00:12:14,717 --> 00:12:16,893
and nobody has been charged.

353
00:12:17,033 --> 00:12:19,683
But markets do not wait for verdicts.

354
00:12:19,683 --> 00:12:20,925
They price stories,

355
00:12:20,925 --> 00:12:22,793
and they price people.

356
00:12:23,133 --> 00:12:26,141
Even a company worth about four trillion

357
00:12:26,141 --> 00:12:28,122
dollars can hang on one name,

358
00:12:28,122 --> 00:12:29,100
one weekend,

359
00:12:29,100 --> 00:12:30,703
and one question.

360
00:12:30,950 --> 00:12:33,274
Next time on The Hidden Economics,

